      <h1 id="updating-hardware-on-nodes-running-on-vsphere" class="group scroll-mt-20">Updating hardware on nodes running on vSphere<a href="#updating-hardware-on-nodes-running-on-vsphere" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h1>
