      <p class="_abstract">Virtual hardware updates can be scheduled to occur when a virtual machine is powered on or rebooted. You can schedule your virtual hardware updates exclusively in vCenter by following <a href="https://docs.vmware.com/en/VMware-vSphere/7.0/com.vmware.vsphere.vm_admin.doc/GUID-96C06236-C271-4CFE-857E-22D1FDEECC95.html">Schedule a Compatibility Upgrade for a Virtual Machine</a> (VMware vSphere documentation).</p>
